### RSM API · ejemplos rápidos (REST Client extension)
### Instala "humao.rest-client" en VS Code y haz clic en "Send Request" sobre cada bloque.

@base = http://localhost:8001/api

### 1) Login como Cedente demo
# @name loginCedente
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cedente@demo.eu",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

### 2) Login como Reasegurador demo
# @name loginRea
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reasegurador@demo.eu",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

###
@tokenCedente = {{loginCedente.response.body.access_token}}
@tokenRea = {{loginRea.response.body.access_token}}

### 3) Yo (verifica el JWT)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCedente}}

### 4) Marketplace de packs
GET {{base}}/marketplace/packs
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRea}}

### 5) Crear un Submission Pack (como cedente)
POST {{base}}/submission-packs
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCedente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Property Cat Test 2026",
  "branch": "Property",
  "reinsurance_type": "Excess of Loss",
  "country_region": "España",
  "coverage_period": "01/01/2026 – 31/12/2026",
  "cession_pct": 30,
  "premiums_y1": 10000000, "premiums_y2": 9500000, "premiums_y3": 9000000,
  "loss_ratio_y1": 60, "loss_ratio_y2": 55, "loss_ratio_y3": 62,
  "description": "Test pack creado desde REST Client",
  "status": "published",
  "broker_id": null
}

### 6) Expresar interés (como reasegurador) — sustituye PACK_ID
POST {{base}}/interests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRea}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pack_id": "PACK_ID_AQUÍ",
  "message": "Interesados en cotizar este programa."
}

### 7) Listar operaciones
GET {{base}}/operations
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCedente}}

### 8) Audit log (admin)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@rsm.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###
@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

GET {{base}}/admin/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
